			"notes": "# 0.11-fabric-26.3-snapshot-8\n\n渲染后端迁移至独立仓库 [RenderShard/renderapi](https://github.com/RenderShard/renderapi)。\n\n- 移除内置 GL、Vulkan、meshlet 与批处理实现\n- libglTF 保留 glTF 解析与适配层，渲染交给 renderapi\n- GpuSubmit 适配 RenderSubmit，GpuResources 适配 MeshResources\n- fabric.mod.json 声明依赖 renderapi\n\n## 变更\n\n- refactor: 渲染后端迁移至 renderapi\n\n## 依赖\n\n- renderapi `0.11-fabric-26.3-snapshot-8`（GitHub Packages：`https://maven.pkg.github.com/RenderShard/renderapi`）"
